% | codom    | codomain of a morphism (i.e. the target object of a morphism)                                     | 
% | coker    | cokernel of a morphism (in algebra, this is the codomain modulo the image)                        |
% | im       | image of a morphism                                                                               |
% | ker      | kernel of a morphism                                      we                                        |
% | id       | identity                                                                                          |
% | proj     | projection (alternative to using \pi)                                                             |
% | sign     | parity of a permutation                                                                           |
% | sgn      | sign of a number in an ordered algebraic structure                                                |
% | lspan    | linear span (span is already occupied, probably for spacing)                                      |
% | dim      | dimension of an object                                                                            |
% | deg      | degree of an object (e.g. polynomial )                                                            |
