% | Arsinh   | sinus cardinalis (normed)             |
% | Arsinh   | integral sine                         |
% | Arsinh   | integral logarithm                    |
% | Arsinh   | Arcus cotangens                       |
% | Arsinh   | Arcus secans                          |
% | Arsinh   | Arcus cosecans                        |
% | Arsinh   | secans hyperbolicus                   |
